=== the baseline restore, completed after the reconcile ===

The HelmRelease reconcile re-applied the chart's release (rev 78, chart
0.2.183) but did NOT roll the campaign's manual patches back: the backend
and the frontend Deployments kept the campaign's image tags and the
campaign's AGENT_* env rows, and Helm does not own them any more.

The baseline was therefore restored from the release's OWN manifest (the
helm-controller release Secret `sh.helm.release.v1.genieai.v78` — the
chart's rendered spec for those two Deployments):

  kubectl apply --server-side --force-conflicts   (the two Deployments)
  kubectl -n genieai set env deploy/genieai-genieai-umbrella-backend \
      AGENT_ENABLED- AGENT_SERVICE_URL-            (the campaign's rows)

